<description>&lt;p&gt;Venezuelan forces bombed an ELN guerrilla camp in Apure, killing at least 19 rebels, while a U.S. drone strike hit an ELN drug depot nearby, causing at least 20 deaths. The United States is negotiating a legal framework for troops in Caracas, coordinating drone strikes on cartels with Venezuelan authorities, and discussing a one-day operation to capture Maduro. President Trump defended the Hegseth amid an impeachment threat, citing successful operations in Iran and Venezuela. Colombia expelled 80 alleged criminal Venezuelans, and Nicaragua excluded Cuba and Venezuela from its military cooperation for the first time since 2020. 2 battle-related deaths in 2007, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxPRkdYaklER2lEbFRnMVdoTmllTERsU3JhN1ZuUkE4ZWZISEdIa0s1YVNuUmVXWTJTcThLM01leVdBWTZSdVFZdVNsOXQ5TU5TV0ZJMllNT3ZPUWxQU256MDRVVEdrX1BTdzhPSnNfQzc0VWhKb2ttMWxDYVA1R3I3d1hFM1o4a0dqNzdwcUtQSm13dldxOWxndHZzaFQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxOb19kbjZoNTBPaGNqNUFKeFZYR2dzOWlNN0ZfS0hRUC1zWUR5TWgwM3pnWmtTSGNDcEsybFVwUktHY1BSQ0pxOTdvLVZFbC1Gc25KVjBLbWNUZTVOejhpZjhUajU2emRCSU1CZHVkdU44Znh2b21WQnhPTWM5YllzM2kwSQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxPNHdfblJfYzB0aUpiUmt0TDdIT3hCVjBxM0o1V205R3Z2RWdaaGhQWC1PeTlJQkxkMGFZc3p3TThNOWxWazl1Z0RTcDBKNGtIaXVWZU9CcGZMZFV0c0dOZ19lcUVGSjZmd1llNlR5QllDLU5FRkt5b25vZnoyU3NpeTRQVzFJRWNzNlFVS25qcmNXRHFtNENFaFpVbkRZNkFZU0lIQjlhWQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Black Chronicle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxPR19pUXp3b1FfUnRkMlI5ZWxBTjREUFNwUjJPaFlXWWlfZTJVX0VibnZFODNCb0lVSS0zZVdMQS1XSHpJcUlONlB4MlJVd0M2WUlOTkVBM2VmcndBUUxLb0RabXRpbm4zQ2dycHM5U2dSaGFZWjFZaERfWEZET1UyYjdh